    "description": {
      "value": "<p>[[/attack extended]]. [[/damage average extended]]. If the target is a Humanoid not cursed by a slaad, it is subjected to the following effect. <em>Constitution Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=GPKbX3hgo4y9raYp]]. <em>Failure:</em> The target is cursed. The cursed target can't regain Hit Points, and its Hit Point maximum decreases by 10 (3d6) after every 24 hours and doesn't return to normal after finishing a Long Rest. If the curse reduces the target's Hit Point maximum to 0, the curse ends, and instead of dying, the target instantly transforms into a @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.creatures.Actor.Clf6mcVo0QkGiKmM]{Red Slaad} or, if it can cast spells of level 3 or higher, a @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.creatures.Actor.NxVDm336C1FUCj8V]{Green Slaad}. Only a <em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplWish000000]{Wish}</em> spell can reverse this transformation.</p>",
